# Status note (v2): Re-verified on feature/pAI-s23-crosshost-shared-write-path @ b0781316.
# Test advertised_ip_peer_send_and_ack_reach_the_shared_router still uses RecordingRouter (unit spy).
# Does NOT satisfy sprint doc runtime-evidence acceptance bar.
# Real integration test against daemon-pair with advertised virtual-Ethernet IP needed.
# This is currently the sole remaining architectural blocking gap preventing QA PASS on AICH-S3.
#
# Status update (v3): FIXED on feature/pAI-s23-crosshost-shared-write-path @ a856fd4a.
# Commits e9c44882 and a856fd4a deliver runtime-evidence acceptance bar via test
# advertised_ip_peer_write_uses_real_dispatcher_persists_and_nudges.
# Uses real HttpsListenerSet, real TcpStream + TLS, real DaemonRequestDispatcher,
# receiver-side ULID readback via RequestEnvelope::Receive/ReadQuery, real nudge proof
# via threaded GraftReceiverListener and mpsc::sync_channel.
# Quality-mgr independently verified: local test passed, full CI green (macos/ubuntu/windows).
# Finding-level status remains open pending quality-mgr determination (not auto-promoting).
#
# Status update (v4): Req-qa round 3 reconfirmation (2026-07-26) on PR #629 @ 985a6d46.
# Req-qa explicitly reconfirmed 0 Blocking findings remain and verified original ATM-QA-002/AI23-BLOCK-001
# defect (unit-only RecordingRouter, no real dispatcher/persistence/nudge proof) as resolved by
# e9c44882's real daemon-pair test. Quality-mgr independently verified via local test run and full CI green
# (Test macos/ubuntu/windows-latest all pass, Clippy pass, Format check pass, Just lint all pass).
# Top-level status flipped to "fixed" for s23 branch @ 985a6d46 confirmed-green PR tip.
# S24-S30 branch occurrences remain open: not rechecked yet, require separate recheck when those branches PR.

