  triage:note "Round-3 fix verified 2026-07-26: commits e9c44882 (test(ai23): prove real peer ingress persistence) and a856fd4a (test(ai23): make expired deadline proof portable). Real daemon-pair integration test now satisfies sprint doc acceptance bar. Uses real HttpsListenerSet::bind_enabled HTTPS peer listener, real TcpStream::connect + TLS handshake (ClientConnection/StreamOwned), real DaemonRequestDispatcher::new_for_test, receiver-side ULID readback via RequestEnvelope::Receive/ReadQuery filtered by origin ID, and post-persistence graft nudge capture via real threaded GraftReceiverListener and mpsc::sync_channel. Quality-mgr independently verified via local test run and full CI green (Test macos/ubuntu/windows pass, Clippy pass, Format check pass, Just lint pass). PR #629 HEAD a856fd4a fully green." ;
  triage:occursIn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/s23/a856fd4a> .

